{"task":"PHASE57_POST_SELECTION_LOW_HIGH_PATH_ANATOMY_V1","date":"2026-09-19","referenceHead":"8ababb7cc412a7b7dd7e0d09611d1bb66a5dd8e8","pr":{"url":"https://github.com/Iam-2squared/ark-terminal/pull/587","number":587,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":true,"body":"## Status\n\n- 🟢 LONG-only Cash Equity research contract / clean-205 split / Claude disposition aligned\n- 🟢 Formal L0 acquisition, immutable-cache verification, PIT admission and one-command census path ready\n- 🟢 Causal 1m→5m and Development-only L1 full-cross-section construction ready\n- 🟢 L2 has one fixed causal feature set, one ridge model family, three predeclared targets, C-fit / D-select / C+D-freeze\n- 🟢 Shared raw interface and four-stage integrated comparison/cash-ledger harness ready\n- 🔴 Formal L0 remains data-blocked; J-Quants provider requests remain 0\n\n## Frozen acquisition plan\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Plan SHA-256 | `2a10ba6f49addaec91251cb5cb45ea1bcd21356b4c1c9d2bccc20f6aace7a258` |\n| Evaluation sessions | 205 |\n| Non-evaluation causal warm-up | 2024-09-09 Daily only |\n| Daily requests | 206 |\n| Dated Master requests | 205 |\n| L0 minute requests | 0 |\n| Base total | 411 |\n\nThe one extra Daily request is required to compute the adjusted close-to-close return for the first Development A session. It is not an evaluation session and cannot affect split accounting.\n\n## Remaining acquisition blockers\n\nOnly three operational blockers remain:\n\n1. Confirm the private non-Git cache destination.\n2. Confirm `JQUANTS_API_KEY` presence in the intended runtime without observing its value.\n3. Obtain separate operator approval bound to the exact Plan SHA, 411-request budget and authorized partitions.\n\nThe purge mechanism and storage contract are already implemented/tested; they are not additional per-request approval layers. The current Work runtime has no credential. This PR is not operator acquisition approval.\n\n## Measurement path now ready\n\n- `scripts/acquire_phase57_long_only_l0.mjs`: one-time immutable Daily/Master acquisition, including the causal warm-up.\n- `scripts/run_phase57_long_only_formal_l0_from_cache.mjs`: verifies page and aggregate hashes, preserves all A/B evaluation sessions, then runs Formal L0 without manual stitching.\n- `scripts/run_phase57_long_only_l1.mjs`: builds Development-only causal feature rows and separately hashed evaluator labels.\n- `scripts/run_phase57_long_only_l2_development.mjs`: fits on C, selects the target on D, and freezes a C+D artifact without Validation/OOS.\n- Existing shared replay and comparison interfaces keep one raw dataset reusable by Selector / Entry / EXIT / Allocation / Portfolio.\n\n## Research protection\n\n- L0 is Daily + dated PIT Master only.\n- Intraday is acquired by released Development block and reused end to end.\n- Future outcomes remain evaluator-only.\n- Validation, Validation Replication, Primary OOS, Contingency OOS and Reserve remain sealed.\n- Winner-only performance claims, outcome-based sampling, SHORT, margin and leverage remain prohibited.\n- Completion remains Current Ark vs integrated cash-equity LONG-only under the same window and cost model.\n\n## Verification\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---:|\n| Focused LONG-only tests | 29/29 PASS |\n| Full `predict/tests/*.test.mjs` | 2,608/2,608 PASS |\n| Syntax / diff check | PASS |\n| GitHub CI | 3/3 PASS |\n| J-Quants provider requests | 0 |\n| Safety flags | unchanged / all write and trading paths false |\n| Lane Y / main / live circuit | untouched |\n\nDetailed design: `docs/phase57-long-only-data-budget-and-dataset-split.md`\n","title":"Phase57: freeze LONG-only data budget and dataset split","base":"main","base_sha":"f43abbbb41718e513d46c69c81b2efcf6653ab07","head":"research/phase57-long-only-cash-equity","head_sha":"8ababb7cc412a7b7dd7e0d09611d1bb66a5dd8e8","head_repo_id":1316438647,"head_repo_full_name":"Iam-2squared/ark-terminal","merge_commit_sha":"fc5c2af1d701b0b54f253846826fffaa